0,north,"My goal is to reach the stairs down. I am starting from the north side of a rectangular area with a horizontal wall near the north, northeast, and northwest directions, and a vertical wall far west. The stairs must be located below the horizontal wall. To reach the stairs, I will need to move down below the horizontal wall. Since I can only move in cardinal directions or diagonals, I will need to move west or northwest to clear the rectangular area and then move south. I will also be on the lookout for any doors or passages that I can open with the 'open' action. My plan will be to first move north and east to clear the horizontal wall to the east, then move northwest to clear the rectangular area, and finally move south to reach the stairs. I will use my inventory to kick any locked doors or chests.","message:


